2. Honu (wt.honu.pw) by Varunda: session, kill and experience details used for
   lifetime history, assists and session checks, and the per-alert participant
   lists behind the oracle's outlier reports.

3. PS2Alerts (ps2alerts.com): alert history used to grow and test the oracle's
   prediction trees (oracle-worker/history). The PS2Alerts source code is
   GPL-3.0; no PS2Alerts code is included here.

4. PS2 Radar (ps2radar.com): second-opinion results for flagged players
   (data/radar.json, oracle radar cache).

5. Weapon comparison page (weapon-compare.html): inspired by
   Izubrr/planetside_weapon_compare (https://github.com/Izubrr/planetside_weapon_compare,
   no license stated, so no code was copied) and B4rrCH/Ps2TtkCalculator
   (https://github.com/B4rrCH/Ps2TtkCalculator, MIT; idea of a kill-time
   distribution only). The maths here is our own (weapons-model.mjs); weapon data
   and images are Daybreak's (item 1).

6. Ideal ADAD calculator page (weapon-adad.html): method paraphrased from
   Iridar's Weapon Mechanics guide (cmdrcyrious.com, archived copy linked on
   the page); the 2018 weapon numbers come from the Stats sheet of Iridar's
   Toolbox v6h (Stats sheet dated 2018-08-19), the current numbers from the
   Census API via the site's weapon snapshot (item 1). No code was copied.

